977,"w":0.40262580871582032,"h":0.013081394686243808,"y":0.46511627942528899,"text":"You want to go to a concert but the tickets shouldn't"},{"y":0.48091286319937698,"w":0.13347920417785644,"h":0.011819694645672008,"text":"be too expensive.","x":0.061269152870954996},{"h":0.01327800829875514,"y":0.52904564331988568,"w":0.38949672698974613,"text":"2 Your little sister wants to play with you but you're","x":0.035010941155017399},{"text":"really tired today.","w":0.13129102706909179,"y":0.54505813945592996,"h":0.01308139547767484,"x":0.056892780994994577},{"w":0.010940918922424311,"x":0.035010941058481501,"text":"3","y":0.5930232561988088,"h":0.010174418089300752},{"text":"You want to go for a jog but it has to stop raining.","x":0.05908097556199074,"w":0.36980304718017576,"y":0.59294605800822542,"h":0.0132780086944706},{"x":0.03501094005616235,"h":0.014613287676419451,"text":"4 Your parents need to buy a bigger car but they","y":0.64098837221888261,"w":0.37417942047119146},{"h":0.016652517991441962,"w":0.184555721282959,"x":0.05875601785974309,"text":"cannot afford it this year.","y":0.65409661877411041},{"y":0.70494186044430207,"h":0.01308139547767484,"w":0.41356674194335941,"text":"5 You're thinking of going for a walk. You have a lot of","x":0.035010935614753685},{"h":0.009222355126345283,"text":"work.","x":0.058964626412410438,"w":0.041808166503906251,"y":0.72213300847495776},{"y":0.76887966819462672,"x":0.03501094137841701,"w":0.40481399536132812,"h":0.013278007903039679,"text":"6 You would like to get a part-time job, but you need"},{"h":0.0132780086944706,"y":0.78340248945454616,"text":"to study for your exams.","w":0.18161924362182616,"x":0.059080968159911151},{"y":0.0072674422886062073,"x":0.51641138243335805,"h":0.020533387591730068,"w":0.44201313018798827,"text":"FOCUS 2 GRAMMAR REVIEW"},{"h":0.017499758296982471,"text":"Modal verbs for obligation and permission","x":0.48577681207651824,"y":0.0697095435245777,"w":0.43544857025146477},{"y":0.097383721479552543,"x":0.48796499911843599,"text":"To express obligation or necessity, we use:","w":0.31291027069091798,"h":0.013081394686243808},{"x":0.48796499960839979,"h":0.013081394686243808,"text":"• must, especially when we refer to something the speaker","y":0.11482558167213974,"w":0.43326038360595709},{"text":"feels is necessary or important:","h":0.016886988912875212,"x":0.50287286116395558,"y":0.12657337461092799,"w":0.22615545272827153},{"text":"I must phone Mum.","w":0.14879649162292485,"x":0.50328228183259294,"y":0.14389534913169522,"h":0.011706310683760934},{"x":0.48796499445173053,"h":0.013081394686243919,"text":"• have to, especially when we refer to something that is","y":0.16133720957911646,"w":0.41137855529785156},{"text":"necessary because of a rule or law, or because someone","x":0.50328227289483496,"y":0.17587209357257572,"w":0.40919036865234371,"h":0.013081394686243919},{"text":"else says so:","w":0.089899759292602521,"x":0.50537834882326327,"y":0.19148972263748565,"h":0.010915903431745866},{"w":0.27571115493774412,"h":0.011655649604639051,"text":"We have to wear a uniform at school.","y":0.20494186072326503,"x":0.50328228155738597},{"y":0.21947674449311838,"w":0.22757110595703123,"h":0.013081394686243808,"x":0.50547046831980669,"text":"She has to be home at 10p.m."},{"text":"• need to: need to is similar to have to","h":0.012528159905271452,"w":0.28695617675781243,"x":0.48782418331697658,"y":0.23650805618807169},{"x":0.50328228202193859,"h":0.0132780086944706,"y":0.25145228209420467,"w":0.28884025573730465,"text":"I need to sleep eight hours every night."},{"h":0.0132780086944706,"x":0.50547046294800058,"w":0.35448577880859367,"text":"Ann often needs to look after her younger sister.","y":0.26597510363392063},{"w":0.36323848724365237,"h":0.01327800829875514,"text":"To express lack of obligation or necessity, we use:","y":0.28921161814753948,"x":0.48796500599524151},{"x":0.48796498927293003,"y":0.30663900395557919,"w":0.12472647666931153,"text":"• don't have to:","h":0.011674949044508609},{"y":0.32116182588542797,"w":0.39387306213378903,"h":0.013278007903039679,"text":"You don't have to vacuum every day - once a week is","x":0.50328228198926894},{"h":0.011627906387772224,"w":0.063457326889038046,"text":"enough.","x":0.50328227809450354,"y":0.33575581405417587},{"h":0.013278008298755251,"text":"My dad doesn't have to wake up early. He starts work at","w":0.41794307708740241,"x":0.5032822838122436,"y":0.35020746877505526},{"text":"twelve.","x":0.50545258426330875,"y":0.36623342416974991,"w":0.050363979339599574,"h":0.0088122213529847615},{"x":0.48796498769347607,"w":0.19037199020385742,"y":0.3821576764700767,"text":"• don't need to\/needn't:","h":0.01173767192729791},{"h":0.013278008694470711,"x":0.5032822713449292,"y":0.39668049756004486,"w":0.32385120391845701,"text":"You don't need to go to university this year."},{"y":0.41279069793256729,"h":0.011690630061992557,"text":"You needn't do the washing up. We've got a dishwasher.","w":0.417943115234375,"x":0.50328227692876426},{"h":0.015778395941643319,"text":"To express permission, we use:","y":0.43444476925112085,"w":0.22817955017089842,"x":0.48757923374345224},{"text":"• can:","w":0.048140044212341249,"h":0.010174418089300863,"x":0.48796498943649896,"y":0.45348837229619265},{"h":0.013278008298755251,"text":"You can invite some friends if you want.","x":0.50328227789027946,"w":0.28665206909179686,"y":0.46639004149661711},{"text":"• be allowed to:","w":0.129102840423584,"h":0.010174418089300752,"x":0.48796499278054939,"y":0.48546511651857638},{"h":0.011627906783487796,"x":0.50547047314403026,"y":0.49999999989877042,"text":"Students are allowed to work part-time.","w":0.2954047966003418},{"x":0.48796498645880093,"y":0.52180232569466878,"w":0.38293216705322264,"h":0.013081394686243808,"text":"To express lack of permission or prohibition, we use:"},{"x":0.48575147007303399,"h":0.010309615075835499,"y":0.54063007612681635,"text":"• can't:","w":0.061319818496704093},{"w":0.39824943542480462,"h":0.013278008298755251,"y":0.55518672193066565,"text":"You can't leave the classroom without permission from","x":0.50328227783829083},{"x":0.50328227622529542,"y":0.57122093041755906,"w":0.096280088424682608,"h":0.010174418089300752,"text":"your teacher."},{"x":0.48577681338537704,"y":0.58713692962409836,"text":"• mustn't: (a strong prohibition)","w":0.23851202011108397,"h":0.01327800829875514},{"text":"You mustn't play loud music after 10 p.m.","x":0.50547046773813176,"y":0.60165975092762247,"w":0.3019693565368653,"h":0.01327800829875514},{"text":"• not be allowed to: (a strong prohibition)","x":0.48577680546745472,"y":0.6206395351782068,"w":0.31509845733642572,"h":0.011725610123630381},{"x":0.50328229029553473,"h":0.013278008298755251,"w":0.33916847229003899,"text":"You aren't allowed to speak during the exam.","y":0.63360995851204349},{"h":0.011775064666241564,"y":0.67717842333869116,"x":0.48796498713445685,"w":0.42013130187988285,"text":"1 Complete the sentences with the correct forms of"},{"text":"must or have to.","w":0.1312910270690919,"y":0.69331395381872163,"h":0.010174418089300752,"x":0.51203500944138414},{"x":0.53829322141232427,"h":0.01180401402390352,"text":"We have to go to school this Saturday - we're having","y":0.71203319501300599,"w":0.39824943542480462},{"h":0.011816076223286398,"text":"a rehearsal for a new play.","y":0.72655601660238278,"x":0.53829322060476981,"w":0.19474834442138678},{"y":0.74273255839673646,"text":"1l've heard it's a great novel. I","w":0.23413566589355472,"h":0.0087209297908292793,"x":0.51859956018779596},{"h":0.010379474687378432,"text":"read it!","x":0.87964989140854721,"w":0.059080963134765629,"y":0.74273255832453566},{"text":"2 All students","y":0.75726141094530086,"x":0.51859956569640908,"w":0.10722100257873535,"h":0.0087269608905207186},{"y":0.75726141071357655,"x":0.75711159931446304,"h":0.010373443983402453,"text":"wear uniforms in","w":0.1269146537780762},{"h":0.011114901625763784,"y":0.772785572400